Z||000000||8Ball||10-26-2001||10:15 PM||||ok I just need to vent for a few.<BR>This is how my week went.<P>Monday, I had a blowout on the right rear tire.<P>Tuesday, Learned not only are my valve cover gaskets leaking but My head gasket is leaky as well.<P>Wensday, nothing major but did over heat due to air in cooling system from leaky head gasket.<P>Thursday, bought a tire. The stoooopid arse who put the tire on my car knew nothing about Fiero's.    Yep you guessed it. He jacked it up from the side crushing my coolant pipe and smashing my ground effects.<P>And Finally we are at today. Firday, Car dies in a turning lane on a very busy and very deadly highway. In my haste to get the car started i break the key off inside the ignition. Now I start my car with a flathead  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I think it is time for a new motor and some better luck.<P>Thanks for letting me vent. And what did I ever do that was so wrong that I have this bad karma. I must have been hitler or something in my last life. SHEESH!!!!!!!!<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Mattyman||10-26-2001||10:51 PM||||That really sucks, but think positive. <P>Maybe next monday you will get a free tire, <P>On tuesday your gaskets may become unleaky.<P>On wednesday the only thing that will over heat is the inside cabin because u have the heat on.  <P>On thursday, new ground effects will be in your mailbox.<BR> <BR>And on friday, your flathead screwdriver will break but you will find a new one along side the road.  <P>Hey it can happen||||reg||1
